    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i cant just rest. even when i sleep i'm thinking about the next morning, the next diaper, the next bill, the next crisis. resting doesnt exist for me. everything is just tied to me. it feels like the only way to actually find peace or be quiet would be if i just wasn't here anymore. does that even make sense? it feels like the only logical exit.",
